PLAIN-ENGLISH SUMMARY (for convenience only; the terms below are what count)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  You CAN, for free:
    - use Ark as your browser, at home or at work
    - read, study, build and modify the code
    - share Ark or your modified version, for free, with the credit intact
    - fork it under a different name, teach with it, research with it
    - use it in schools, charities, nonprofits and public institutions
    - review it, write about it, or make videos about it (monetized or not)

  You MUST:
    - credit visiuun visibly, in the app and wherever you offer it
    - keep this license and its notices with every copy
    - say so if you changed it, and use your own name and icon for forks

  You CANNOT, without a separate written license from visiuun:
    - sell it, charge for it, or put any of it behind a paywall
    - add ads, sponsored or affiliate search, or other paid placements
    - collect, sell or monetize the data of the people who use it
    - ship it inside, or as part of, a for-profit product or service
    - remove or hide the credit, or pass a fork off as the real Ark

